	"description": "This is a server side only Minecraft forge mod built for Minecraft version 1.12.2. It allows you to play a game of bingo in-game, with all mods and vanilla survival obtainable items as bingo goals. You can either play alone or as a team. You receive a bingo card of size from 3x3 up to 9x9, and you cross out items by finding them in survival mode. ",
